d the post-iteration gate. The auto three-errors stop (reason error) reaches it through if_existing_terminal_path. The duration stop in step_check_max_duration runs it, once, before its jump to phase_synthesis. Never run it when the pivot continues the loop.\"\n1158:              step_prepare_divergent_pivot:\n1176:              step_dispatch_pivot_seat:\n1178:                for_each: \"seat_id in [seat-001, seat-002, seat-003], in that order. Run this step and then step_record_pivot_seat for one seat before the next seat starts. Seat roles: seat-001 analytical, seat-002 critical, seat-003 pragmatic.\"\n1188:                failure_contract: \"A native dispatch failure binds status=rejected, a {name,message} error, and the measured timestamps/duration, then proceeds to step_record_pivot_seat.\"\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"wc -l .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review.yaml; grep -n \\\"step_\\\\|phase_\\\" .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review.yaml | head -80\"}"},"time":{"start":1794830048234,"end":1794830049588}}}}
