health recor\nd runtimes in README.md. Reasons: second heredoc on one line (no... |\n| Phase 037 review pass six remediation | Complete | six P2 fixes (docs, comments, scoreRun type, TEMP and TMP, buffer test premise), five reasons. Suite 2326/0, floors and eval unchanged, 0\n33 rescore byte-identical. Pass five report kept as review-report-pass-5.md, review-report.md is pass six |\n| Catch-up merge of origin/main, 2026-11-16 | Done, 0eb0c296f4d | 31 main commits. Four documents conflicted with the hook library cleanup (session-readers README, skill-advisor-hook.md, Vib\ne prompt-advisor.mjs, ENV-REFERENCE.md), each line settled against the merged code; index regenerated. Advisor dist rebuilt. Suite 2326/0, FLOOR 24/44 0/35 2/44, EVAL [160,49,21,5], Vibe and\n DSH hook tests 19/19, hook-flags 31/31. 0 behind origin/main |\n| Unsafe restated, checkout boundary | Fixed in phase 038 | startState judged an ask or must-not-start write without the run's checkout, so a live arena under the temp folder read as scratch\n. Now judged against the checkout. Moved counts: 007 set devin pre 1 to 2, devin post 1 to 2, opencode post 0 to 1; pre set devin pre 1 to 2; final set devin post 1 to 2; 033 arm opencode on\n 0 to 1. Runs in 038 scratch/unsafe-rows.txt: mns-chat-03 on devin and openco... |\n| Correction, phase 037 README claim | Fixed in phase 038 | 037 said the Pi, DSH and Vibe hooks write no health record. They do: each runs the Claude handler, which persists one. 038 scratch\n/hook-health-check.mjs under an empty TMPDIR prints dsh 1 vibe 1 pi 1. README.md now names Claude Code, Codex, Devin, Cursor, Pi, DSH and Vibe and says only the OpenCode plugin writes none. \n037's measured-behavior grep was the wrong test |\n| Alignment final, run 20261116T085341Z | Branch-caused P0 0 and P1 0 after pha... | 15 surfaces, 109 commits, 4 lanes and a critic, P0 1 P1 11 P2 26. Fixed in 038: A-1 unsafe checkout, C-01\n README health records, D-01 and CRIT-4 :unattended, :with-* and chained suffixes, D-02 tests reading AI_SESSION_CHILD (suite now 2328/0 with the flag unset and set). Open with reason: BAT-0\n2 P0 is the operator-local alignment surface-map.yaml naming .skilled/hooks/dispatch/lib, which main m... |\n| Alignment recheck, 20261116T111907Z | Branch-caused P0 0 and P1 0 | recheck.cjs from run 20261116T085341Z at 15d8b463396: resolved 0, still open 13, new 0, needs review 26, read by hand. D\n-02 is listed open because its suggested fix edited the test, while 038 cleared the inherited flag in vitest.config.ts; the suite passes 2328/0 with AI_SESSION_CHILD=1. A-1, C-01, CRIT-4 and\n D-01 read changed differently; each is covered by the tests 038 added and the merged-t... |\n| Final state, 2026-11-16 | Complete, unpushed | Catch-up merges 15d8b463396 (48 main commits, README rewrite taken with the /create:sk-skill rename carried into it) and 0bd3abba438 (19 comm\nits, index regenerated). Merged-tree gates: advisor build, typecheck, suite 2328/0 with AI_SESSION_CHILD unset and set, FLOOR 24/44 0/35 2/44, EVAL [160,49,21,5], spec-kit CLI check exit 0, \nhook health dsh 1 vibe 1 pi 1, overlay test exit 0. Branch 0 behin... |\n| Correction, README health records after the merge | Superseded by main | The 038 README fix named the seven runtimes that write a health record. Main's README rewrite, merged in 15d8b46339\n6, removed that paragraph, so HEAD's README carries neither 037's false claim nor 038's fix. No other doc under the advisor or hooks repeats the claim (rg for write none finds none). The ada\npters' behaviour is unchanged: hook-health-check prints dsh 1 vibe 1 pi 1 on the merged tree |\n| Unsafe fix coverage check | Holds for every runtime | Every stored run line in the 007 sets and the 033 arm (claude, codex, devin, dsh, opencode and pi) carries locator.projectDir, so the \ncheckout boundary applies to all of them and the restated counts are complete. The Python fallback scorer only strips mode suffixes from prompt text, like scorer/