{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794830729849,"sessionID":"ses_e1bcb8a74ffeeMt5FpZ1Wzv563","part":{"partID":"prt_1e43f40f1001qPhsJ7fzeL6Kzw","sessionID":"ses_e1bcb8a74ffeeMt5FpZ1Wzv563","messageID":"msg_1e43f2da8001OrXNxufe8dTWRO","type":"tool","id":"call_6c64a5bbf1bc4be39291edcd","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"---\ntitle: Deep Review Strategy - attach-config-7\ndescription: Review pass seven strategy for the typed command matcher, the advisor vitest config and the guarding tests.\nimportance_tier: normal\ncontextType: planning\n---\n\n# Deep Review Strategy - Session Tracking\n\n## 2. TOPIC\n\nReview pass seven of command surfacing, lineage `attach-config-7`. Area files:\n`runtime/lib/command-attach.ts` (typed command matcher, including the chained\n`:auto`/`:confirm`/`:autopilot`/`:unattended` and `:with-context`/`:with-phases`/`:with-research`\nsuffix reading), `runtime/vitest.config.ts` (inherited `AI_SESSION_CHILD` cleared, per-run temp\nfolder), and the tests that pin a child or parent session plus the new boundary and arena-buffer\ntests. Diffs are read with `git -c core.fsmonitor=false diff 85550ee946e 1c3d62def5a -- <path>`.\n\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- [ ] D1 Correctness, Logic errors, off-by-one, wrong return types, broken invariants\n- [ ] D2 Security, Injection, auth bypass, secrets exposure, unsafe deserialization\n- [ ] D3 Traceability, Spec/code alignment, checklist evidence, cross-reference integrity\n- [ ] D4 Maintainability, Patterns, clarity, documentation quality, safe follow-on change cost\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- Not re-scoring stored transcripts or re-running the routing accuracy scorer.\n- Not reviewing the scorer's unsafe-verdict logic, the arena builder's production script, or the\n  root README; those are the `scorer-7` and `docs-7` areas.\n- Not changing code under review. Findings only.\n\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n\n- Convergence at `convergenceThreshold: 0.1`, or `maxIterations: 3`, whichever comes first.\n- Any active P0 keeps the verdict at FAIL and the loop continues under the cap.\n- No retry of a direction recorded as exhausted in section 10.\n\n## 6. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n[None yet -- populated as iterations complete dimension reviews]\n\n| Dimension | Verdict | Iteration | Summary |\n|-----------|---------|-----------|---------|\n| [D1 Correctness] | [PASS/CONDITIONAL/FAIL] | [N] | [1-sentence result] |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 7. RUNNING FINDINGS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- **P0 (Critical):** 0 active\n- **P1 (Major):** 0 active\n- **P2 (Minor):** 0 active\n- **Delta this iteration:** +0 P0, +0 P1, +0 P2\n\n[Findings are tracked in `deep-review-findings-registry.json`.]\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\n\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n\n## 10. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n\n[Populated when a review approach has been tried from multiple angles without yielding new findings]\n\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Completed pivots: 0\n- Failed pivots: 0\n- Audited overrides: 0\n- Swept: none yet\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n\n[Review angles investigated and eliminated, consolidated from iteration dead-end data]\n\n## 12. NEXT FOCUS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\nIteration 1: correctness of the typed command matcher and the vitest config. Read the two\nchanged production surfaces against the documented suffix vocabulary, then the guard tests\nthat pin them. Do not re-report the recorded limits in `review-brief-7.txt`.\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\n\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\n\n- Target pointers: `runtime/lib/command-attach.ts` lines 190-263 (boundary, `MODE_SUFFIX`,\n  `typedCommandIn`, `typedCommandForTop`, `attachCommand` deep-loop gate at line 513);\n  `runtime/vitest.config.ts` lines 1-32 (temp folder and `AI_SESSION_CHILD`);\n  `tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts` lines 410-470 (typed command boundaries);\n  `tests/doctor-brief-render.vitest.ts` lines 70-96 (child marker); \n  `tests/command-behaviour-guards.vitest.ts` lines 750-800 (arena buffer premise).\n- Behavior claims to verify: the matcher reads `:auto`, `:confirm`, `:autopilot`,\n  `:unattended` and `:with-context`, `:with-phases`, `:with-research`, including chains in any\n  order, as the typed command and refuses any other suffix; the vitest config clears an inherited\n  `AI_SESSION_CHILD` and gives each run its own temp folder; tests that assert a parent shape\n  pin `childSession: false`.\n- Reuse and conventions: `commandRowFor`/`TRACKED_COMMANDS` own-key lookup; `sk-code-review`\n  severity doctrine; the recorded limits in `review-brief-7.txt` are settled and not reopened.\n- Risks and gaps: `lib/scorer/text.ts` and `scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs`\n  carry their own suffix rules; they are outside this lineage's area and only count as\n  integration evidence. Graph store writes are skipped so the lineage write surface stays inside\n  this folder.\n\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\n| `spec_code` | core | [pending/pass/partial/fail/blocked] | [N] | [details] |\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | [pending/pass/partial/fail/blocked] | [N] | [details] |\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | [pending/pass/partial/fail/blocked/notApplicable] | [N] | [details] |\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | [pending/pass/partial/fail/blocked/notApplicable] | [N] | [details] |\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | [pending/pass/partial/fail/blocked/notApplicable] | [N] | [details] |\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | [pending/pass/partial/fail/blocked/notApplicable] | [N] | [details] |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts` | [pending] | 0 | 0 | [partial/pending] |\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts` | [pending] | 0 | 0 | [partial/pending] |\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/vitest.config.ts` | [pending] | 0 | 0 | [partial/pending] |\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/doctor-brief-render.vitest.ts` | [pending] | 0 | 0 | [partial/pending] |\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-behaviour-guards.vitest.ts` | [pending] | 0 | 0 | [partial/pending] |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Max iterations: 3\n- Convergence threshold: 0.1\n- Rolling STOP threshold: 0.08\n- No-progress threshold: 0.05\n- Coverage stabilization passes required: 1\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-attach-config-7-1794829999759-g4q8yp, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\n- Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\n- Release-readiness states: in-progress | converged | release-blocking\n- Per-iteration budget: 24 tool calls, 10 minutes\n- Severity threshold: P2\n- Review target type: spec-folder\n- Cross-reference checks: core=[spec_code, checklist_evidence], overlay=[skill_agent, agent_cross_runtime, feature_catalog_code, playbook_capability]\n- Started: 2026-11-16T12:04:52Z\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-config-7/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-config-7/deep-review-strategy.md","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-config-7/deep-review-strategy.md"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\":\"---\\ntitle: Deep Review Strategy - attach-config-7\\ndescription: Review pass seven strategy for the typed command matcher, the advisor vitest config and the guarding tests.\\nimportance_tier: normal\\ncontextType: planning\\n---\\n\\n# Deep Review Strategy - Session Tracking\\n\\n## 2. TOPIC\\n\\nReview pass seven of command surfacing, lineage `attach-config-7`. Area files:\\n`runtime/lib/command-attach.ts` (typed command matcher, including the chained\\n`:auto`/`:confirm`/`:autopilot`/`:unattended` and `:with-context`/`:with-phases`/`:with-research`\\nsuffix reading), `runtime/vitest.config.ts` (inherited `AI_SESSION_CHILD` cleared, per-run temp\\nfolder), and the tests that pin a child or parent session plus the new boundary and arena-buffer\\ntests. Diffs are read with `git -c core.fsmonitor=false diff 85550ee946e 1c3d62def5a -- <path>`.\\n\\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- [ ] D1 Correctness, Logic errors, off-by-one, wrong return types, broken invariants\\n- [ ] D2 Security, Injection, auth bypass, secrets exposure, unsafe deserialization\\n- [ ] D3 Traceability, Spec/code alignment, checklist evidence, cross-reference integrity\\n- [ ] D4 Maintainability, Patterns, clarity, documentation quality, safe follow-on change cost\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n## 4. NON-GOALS\\n\\n- Not re-scoring stored transcripts or re-running the routing accuracy scorer.\\n- Not reviewing the scorer's unsafe-verdict logic, the arena builder's production script, or the\\n  root README; those are the `scorer-7` and `docs-7` areas.\\n- Not changing code under review. Findings only.\\n\\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\\n\\n- Convergence at `convergenceThreshold: 0.1`, or `maxIterations: 3`, whichever comes first.\\n- Any active P0 keeps the verdict at FAIL and the loop continues under the cap.\\n- No retry of a direction recorded as exhausted in section 10.\\n\\n## 6. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n[None yet -- populated as iterations complete dimension reviews]\\n\\n| Dimension | Verdict | Iteration | Summary |\\n|-----------|---------|-----------|---------|\\n| [D1 Correctness] | [PASS/CONDITIONAL/FAIL] | [N] | [1-sentence result] |\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n## 7. RUNNING FINDINGS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- **P0 (Critical):** 0 active\\n- **P1 (Major):** 0 active\\n- **P2 (Minor):** 0 active\\n- **Delta this iteration:** +0 P0, +0 P1, +0 P2\\n\\n[Findings are tracked in `deep-review-findings-registry.json`.]\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\\n\\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\\n\\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\\n\\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\\n\\n## 10. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\\n\\n[Populated when a review approach has been tried from multiple angles without yielding new findings]\\n\\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- Completed pivots: 0\\n- Failed pivots: 0\\n- Audited overrides: 0\\n- Swept: none yet\\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\\n\\n[Review angles investigated and eliminated, consolidated from iteration dead-end data]\\n\\n## 12. NEXT FOCUS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\nIteration 1: correctness of the typed command matcher and the vitest config. Read the two\\nchanged production surfaces against the documented suffix vocabulary, then the guard tests\\nthat pin them. Do not re-report the recorded limits in `review-brief-7.txt`.\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\\n\\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\\n\\n- Target pointers: `runtime/lib/command-attach.ts` lines 190-263 (boundary, `MODE_SUFFIX`,\\n  `typedCommandIn`, `typedCommandForTop`, `attachCommand` deep-loop gate at line 513);\\n  `runtime/vitest.config.ts` lines 1-32 (temp folder and `AI_SESSION_CHILD`);\\n  `tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts` lines 410-470 (typed command boundaries);\\n  `tests/doctor-brief-render.vitest.ts` lines 70-96 (child marker); \\n  `tests/command-behaviour-guards.vitest.ts` lines 750-800 (arena buffer premise).\\n- Behavior claims to verify: the matcher reads `:auto`, `:confirm`, `:autopilot`,\\n  `:unattended` and `:with-context`, `:with-phases`, `:with-research`, including chains in any\\n  order, as the typed command and refuses any other suffix; the vitest config clears an inherited\\n  `AI_SESSION_CHILD` and gives each run its own temp folder; tests that assert a parent shape\\n  pin `childSession: false`.\\n- Reuse and conventions: `commandRowFor`/`TRACKED_COMMANDS` own-key lookup; `sk-code-review`\\n  severity doctrine; the recorded limits in `review-brief-7.txt` are settled and not reopened.\\n- Risks and gaps: `lib/scorer/text.ts` and `scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs`\\n  carry their own suffix rules; they are outside this lineage's area and only count as\\n  integration evidence. Graph store writes are skipped so the lineage write surface stays inside\\n  this folder.\\n\\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\\n| `spec_code` | core | [pending/pass/partial/fail/blocked] | [N] | [details] |\\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | [pending/pass/partial/fail/blocked] | [N] | [details] |\\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | [pending/pass/partial/fail/blocked/notApplicable] | [N] | [details] |\\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | [pending/pass/partial/fail/blocked/notApplicable] | [N] | [details] |\\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | [pending/pass/partial/fail/blocked/notApplicable] | [N] | [details] |\\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | [pending/pass/partial/fail/blocked/notApplicable] | [N] | [details] |\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts` | [pending] | 0 | 0 | [partial/pending] |\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts` | [pending] | 0 | 0 | [partial/pending] |\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/vitest.config.ts` | [pending] | 0 | 0 | [partial/pending] |\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/doctor-brief-render.vitest.ts` | [pending] | 0 | 0 | [partial/pending] |\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-behaviour-guards.vitest.ts` | [pending] | 0 | 0 | [partial/pending] |\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- Max iterations: 3\\n- Convergence threshold: 0.1\\n- Rolling STOP threshold: 0.08\\n- No-progress threshold: 0.05\\n- Coverage stabilization passes required: 1\\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-attach-config-7-1794829999759-g4q8yp, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\\n- Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\\n- Release-readiness states: in-progress | converged | release-blocking\\n- Per-iteration budget: 24 tool calls, 10 minutes\\n- Severity threshold: P2\\n- Review target type: spec-folder\\n- Cross-reference checks: core=[spec_code, checklist_evidence], overlay=[skill_agent, agent_cross_runtime, feature_catalog_code, playbook_capability]\\n- Started: 2026-11-16T12:04:52Z\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\