{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794830891995,"sessionID":"ses_e1bcb8a74ffeeMt5FpZ1Wzv563","part":{"partID":"prt_1e441f083001cWhD6TAdrMjCQ4","sessionID":"ses_e1bcb8a74ffeeMt5FpZ1Wzv563","messageID":"msg_1e441e3a9001zCqvdpPFHDg1Bj","type":"tool","id":"call_0c0370cfbef14492b5d64a9c","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"- **Delta this iteration:** +0 P0, +0 P1, +0 P2\n\n[Findings are tracked in `deep-review-findings-registry.json`.]\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\n\n- Direct diff read plus a reproduction of the changed matcher's exact regexes outside the repository. It proved the positive chain, the unknown-suffix refusal and the boundaries without running the suite or writing outside the lineage. (iteration 1)\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n\n- Nothing failed. Running the repository suite was deliberately not attempted: the lineage write surface forbids cache and temp writes outside it, and the behavior under review is pure string matching. (iteration 1)","oldString":"- **Delta this iteration:** +0 P0, +0 P1, +0 P2\n\n[Findings are tracked in `deep-review-findings-registry.json`.]\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\n\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-config-7/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-config-7/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-config-7/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-config-7/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-config-7/deep-review-strategy.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-config-7/deep-review-strategy.md\n@@ -57,13 +57,13 @@\n <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n \n ## 8. WHAT WORKED\n \n-[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n+- Direct diff read plus a reproduction of the changed matcher's exact regexes outside the repository. It proved the positive chain, the unknown-suffix refusal and the boundaries without running the suite or writing outside the lineage. (iteration 1)\n \n ## 9. WHAT FAILED\n \n-[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n+- Nothing failed. Running the repository suite was deliberately not attempted: the lineage write surface forbids cache and temp writes outside it, and the behavior under review is pure string matching. (iteration 1)\n \n ## 10. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n \n [Populated when a review approach has been tried from multiple angles without yielding new findings]\n","status":"modified","additions":2,"deletions":2}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-config-7/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"- **Delta this iteration:** +0 P0, +0 P1, +0 P2\\n\\n[Findings are tracked in `deep-review-findings-registry.json`.]\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\\n\\n- Direct diff read plus a reproduction of the changed matcher's exact regexes outside the repository. It proved the positive chain, the unknown-suffix refusal and the boundaries without running the suite or writing outside the lineage. (iteration 1)\\n\\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\\n\\n- Nothing failed. Runni